## Central upstream version pins for everything built in this repository.
##
## One authoritative value per upstream project, read by every platform's
## builder, so the TrueNAS .run and the Unraid .plg always target the same
## release. Nothing here is discovered at build time.
##
## Append `# renovate: datasource=... depName=...` after a value to have
## Renovate bump it automatically — see .github/renovate.json.

## Komodo — Core and every Periphery node must run the same release.
KOMODO_VERSION=v2.3.3 # renovate: datasource=github-releases depName=moghtech/komodo
